DESCRIPTION:Amanda Dwyer has a deadpan delivery alongside a wicked sense of
  humour. Amanda regularly performs at comedy clubs all over Scotland and is
  the creator of the Material\, Girl comedy show in Glasgow. Amanda also pro
 vides tour support for Tom Stade\, Susie McCabe and Rachel Fairburn. Amanda
